# Docker build context hygiene for the backend image.
# Without this, host bin/obj folders leak into the build stage and overwrite the
# in-container `dotnet restore` output with Windows-path assets (C:\Users\...),
# which makes `dotnet publish --no-restore` fail inside Linux with exit code 1.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
.vs/
requests.http
